--   (closed, 144-7), the members' reason (144-12), the request, its requester and approver, and
--   the transaction. The market row, its judgements, its settlement records, the positions, the
--   collateral and every SETTLEMENT_PAYOUT stay as they were (ADR-0165 decision 2).
ALTER TYPE "public"."ledger_entry_type" ADD VALUE 'JUDGEMENT_COMPENSATION';--> statement-breakpoint
